WEBVTT

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:12.170
Start with the information basis. Check the information date and whether each statement is recorded, illustrative or conditional.

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:20.420
Follow the parties and rights. See who owns, uses, reviews and administers the asset and related records.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:28.670
Review what could go wrong. Read operating, asset, liquidity and structural risks before considering any scenario.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:36.920
Inspect the document status. Recorded, draft and conditional labels reveal what is complete and what still requires approval.
